{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"“Oh ummmm idk? I mean if I’m dead I’m dead right?”","created_at":"2020-08-11T01:34:56.071000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742556627667910767","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"Well yes.. it can be more complicated than that... you see. The memories she collects leaves behind a part of the person they were attached to.\" she pauses \"Think about Sir Rigatony's sword. He doesn't simply manipulate the shade to look like others who have passed, they are actual fragments of their soul, their memory.\"","created_at":"2020-08-11T01:37:31.349000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742557278951178271","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"“Oh... that makes sense... I think”","created_at":"2020-08-11T01:37:59.208000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742557395800031325","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"The Raven Queen does a similar thing with the memories she collects. Fragmented memories can never fully detach from a soul because it is apart of it.\"","created_at":"2020-08-11T01:38:46.021000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742557592148246589","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"I can pray to the Raven Queen for you and see if she can return her memory... but she usually requires an exchange of gifts. If you really want this, you may have to give her more after death.\"","created_at":"2020-08-11T01:40:15.746000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742557968482172968","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"“Um ok... let’s maybe hold off then in case Guinevere can do anything?”","created_at":"2020-08-11T01:40:52.689000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742558123432083648","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"Wherever your soul goes, some of it will go to her in the form of memories.\"","created_at":"2020-08-11T01:40:53.882000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742558128436019320","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
